  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "美學與產品創意實習",
    "sub_ename": "AESTHETICS AND PRODUCT CREATIVITY PRACTICE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程是實踐『做學問』的課。由助教提供各小組美學展演的專業經驗分享與創意發想，並個別輔導外籍生的學習適應，藉由實作重複演練、排演，訓練學生運用課堂所學美學理論，在沒有成見、零基礎地培養美的靜默直觀感受，再引申對美的真誠熱情，形成原創的產品行銷概念。課程最後作組內評量。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is a practice of brand and fashion theories. It will use practical case drills and rehearsals to train students to use what they have learned in the classroom. It will cultivate a quiet and intuitive experience of the United States without stereotypes and zero ground, and then extend its sincere enthusiasm for the United States to form an original product marketing concept. Internal members assessment will be ficilitated at the end of class.",
